<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Bandar Raya 1996 net up 47 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Bandar Raya 1996 net up 47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     49.8    vs	35.3</p>
<p>    Net profit		152.36   vs     103.33</p>
<p>    Turnover		  546.52   vs     509.04</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  206.21   vs     150.31</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less 11.76   vs add   0.67</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries   less  4.68   vs add   4.38</p>
<p>    Dvidend    (pct)	  7.0    vs	 5.0</p>
<p>Note - Bandara Raya Developments Bhd is mainly involved in property development and construction.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
